GNAI TV HOMEPAGE REPAIR

Target repository: shanta4100/gnaitv

Upload these files to the exact repository paths:
  index.html
  assets/js/app.js
  assets/css/site.css
  test/homepage-assets.test.js

After confirming assets/js/app.js exists, delete this obsolete file:
  assests/js/app.js

Do not change or delete:
  functions/
  _headers
  wrangler.toml
  .github/workflows/cloudflare-pages-deploy.yml
  .github/workflows/gnaitv-quality-gate.yml

Recommended workflow:
  1. Create branch fix/homepage-assets from main.
  2. Apply the four files above.
  3. Delete assests/js/app.js.
  4. Run npm test and npm run validate-schemas.
  5. Open a pull request into main.
  6. Merge only after both checks pass.

This package does not include or modify Cloudflare secrets, DNS settings,
Pages Functions, or production deployment configuration.
